{"step_index":48,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-06T00:37:21Z","thinking":"Analyzing the saved data file to identify businesses and their types. The analysis will first check for the presence of business registration numbers (bizno). Subsequently, the script will classify business types based on the middle digits of the bizno, using a predefined mapping that links these digits to specific business categories.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f2533ba2-96b2-426b-85af-73e28ca73587/scratch/input_batch.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n\nfunction getBizType(bizno) {\n  const clean = (bizno || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  if (clean.length !== 10) return 'UNKNOWN';\n  const mid = clean.substring(3, 5);\n  const midNum = Number(mid);\n  if ((midNum >= 1 && midNum <= 79) || (midNum >= 90 && midNum <= 99)) return '개인사업자';\n  if (['81', '86', '87', '88'].includes(mid)) return '영리법인본점';\n  if (mid === '85') return '영리법인지점';\n  if (mid === '82') return '비영리법인';\n  if (mid === '33') return '사내근로복지기금/단체';\n  return '기타';\n}\n\nconsole.log('Total rows:', lines.length);\n\nconst parsed = lines.map((l, idx) => {\n  const cols = l.split('\\t');\n  const manager = cols[0];\n  let offset = 0;\n  // If cols[0] is 배현명, cols[1] might be state (폐업 등) or empty\n  const status = cols[1];\n  const name = cols[2];\n  const bizno = cols[3];\n  const rep = cols[4];\n  const corpNoCol = cols[13];\n  return {\n    lineNo: idx + 1,\n    colsCount: cols.length,\n    name,\n    bizno,\n    rep,\n    corpNoCol,\n    bizType: getBizType(bizno),\n    rawCols: cols\n  };\n});\n\nparsed.forEach(p => {\n  console.log(\\`[\\${p.lineNo}] \\${p.name} | biz:\\${p.bizno} (\\${p.bizType}) | corpCol: '\\${p.corpNoCol || ''}'\\`);\n});\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\res